# vidIQ MCP lifecycle

Apply this rule only to vidIQ requests and calls. Do not start vidIQ onboarding, account checks,
research, or approvals for unrelated work.

For a vidIQ workflow, read [Live surface notes](../references/live-surface-notes.md), including
when analyzing supplied evidence. Select the relevant available vidIQ skill and load only
its needed references.

For connection help, ambiguous routing, or a tool without a dedicated skill, follow the
[agent guide](../AGENTS.md). Before asynchronous work, read
[Job lifecycle](../references/job-lifecycle.md).
